341 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 188 0 R
/T (Why this solution stands out is that it does not wait for the user to remember their schedule. It turns a routine problem into an automated, context-aware system that watches Google Calendar, checks TomTom traffic, and sends the reminder through Telegram at the right moment. That makes the experience practical, low-friction, and immediately useful in daily life, especially for users who commute, travel often, or manage packed calendars.)
/E (Why this solution stands out is that it does not wait for the user to remember their schedule. It turns a routine problem into an automated, context-aware system that watches Google Calendar, checks TomTom traffic, and sends the reminder through Telegram at the right moment. That makes the experience practical, low-friction, and immediately useful in daily life, especially for users who commute, travel often, or manage packed calendars.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
