/T (The biggest advantage is the end-to-end loop: one user action, the start command in Telegram, unlocks an automated workflow that keeps working in the background. This means the product is not only useful, but also sticky. Users get value before they even ask for it. That kind of proactive behavior builds trust, saves time, and creates a distinct experience that is harder for simple notification tools to replicate.)
